.TH wordCount 3 "September 2026" "Version 1.0" "Library Functions"
.SH NAME
wordCount \- count lines, words, and characters in a file
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B int wordCount(FILE *file, int *lines, int *words, int *chars);
.SH DESCRIPTION
The \fBwordCount\fR function reads the provided \fBfile\fR pointer character by character and calculates the total number of lines, words, and characters, storing the results in the respective integer pointers. It returns 0 on success, or -1 if the file pointer is NULL.
